{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2259e948-456d-85d3-976c-d02166e72d9b",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:11:15-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:08:40-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:08:43-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. I'm calling about flooding at my house, basically it's the storm drain out front and I'm, I'm really not happy. Sorry, you're on speaker, I'm in the kitchen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:08:54-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can hear you. Where's the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:08:58-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty Malbone Road, North End. So basically with the rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago, water came up around that drain and then it came right into my cellar. A few inches. In all the years I've lived here that has never happened. Never."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:09:14-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Is the water still down there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:09:18-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most of it's out now, I pumped what I could. But the crawlspace filled up too, and basically I lost my heat pump. The whole unit. So that's the thing, I have no idea who is supposed to come look at this drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:09:33-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me get the details down so a crew can go look at that drain. Is it clogged with leaves, or was it just overwhelmed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:09:42-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Honestly I don't know, it was full of debris I think, and nobody has ever cleaned it that I've seen. Who do I call to get it checked? Is that you, or is that somebody else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:09:55-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's us, the drains are Public Works. I'm putting in a request for an inspection at sixty Malbone. The damage to your equipment, that's a different question, and I'd have to get you to the right office for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:10:09-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay, but I need somebody to actually call me back. [crosstalk] Sorry, hold on, my, my supervisor is walking past, I work from home but, he's, he's in the, hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:10:20-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:10:22-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. I'm going to keep my voice down a second. But I'm serious, I am angry. A heat pump is thousands of dollars and this is the city's drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:10:32-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I've got your name as Daniela Cordero. Is the number four zero one, five five five, zero one seven one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:10:41-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. And here's the thing. If nobody calls me back today, I'm emailing every council member and the mayor's office. Every one of them. Today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:10:51-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'm flagging it as a flooding complaint with property damage so it gets looked at quickly, and I'll ask the supervisor here to call you. I can't tell you the exact hour, but I'll note that you want it today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:11:05-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Thank you, Denise. I do appreciate you writing it down. I just need someone to come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:11:12-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'll hear from us. Take care."
    }
  ],
